SUMMARY:Panigiri of Profitis Ilias\, Ai-Lias (Psili and Trachy)
LOCATION:Ai-Lias\, Skyros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Profitis Ilias is kept at two hilltop chapels\, Ai-Lias o Psilos on the night of 19-20 July and the Ai-Lias at Trachy on the 20th\, with the tavles of pilaf and goat after the service and music until dawn. Dirt-road access\; go with a local or a 4x4 and a torch.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skyros/#ai-lias-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-ai-lias-psili-and-trachy
